#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0300 expect=noViolation domain=BW
#note "The record-count half of the discriminator: the SAME Define declaration (name=BW) but the dataset now carries one record, so $dataset_record_count == 0 is false and the rule stays quiet. If the count comparison were inverted (firing on a non-empty described dataset) this scenario would red."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
#define dataset-metadata BW name=BW
dataset BW label="Body Weight"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col BWSEQ   type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
---
S1 | BW | 001 | 1
